@en :::: details ### Mapping Velocity Explanation
@zh :::: details ### 映射力度解释
@en * Mapping Velocity will generate events in the timeline where the opacity (for video) or volume (for audio) corresponds directly to the velocity value of each MIDI note, based on the range you set in the script.
@zh * 映射力度将在时间轴中生成事件，其中不透明度（对于视频）或音量（对于音频）根据你在脚本中设置的范围直接对应于每个MIDI音符的力度值。
@en * The standard MIDI velocity range is 0 – 127.
@zh * 标准MIDI力度范围为0 ~ 127。
@en   You can set a custom velocity range and map it to your desired opacity or volume range.
@zh   你可以设置自定义力度范围并将其映射到你所需的不透明度或音量范围。
@en ::: tip Example
@zh ::: tip 示例
@en If you set the velocity range to 64 – 127 and the opacity/volume range to 50% – 100%:
@zh 如果将力度范围设置为64 ~ 127，并将不透明度/音量范围设置为50% ~ 100%：
@en * Notes with velocity 64 (Half velocity in FL Studio or Reaper) will generate at 50% opacity/volume. And notes with velocity 127 will generate at 100% opacity/volume.
@zh * 力度为64（FL Studio或 Reaper中的表示一半力度）的音符将以50%的不透明度/音量生成。力度为127的音符将以100%不透明度/音量生成。
:::
::: important
@en Mapping Velocity does not ignore notes outside your set range.
@zh 映射力度不会忽略设定范围之外的音符。
@en * If a note’s velocity is lower than your minimum setting, the generated event will be muted (0% volume / fully transparent).
@zh * 如果音符的力度低于最小值设置，生成的事件将被静音（0%音量/完全透明）。
@en * If a note’s velocity is higher than your maximum setting, the generated event will be set to 100% opacity/volume.
@zh * 如果音符的力度高于最大值设置，生成的事件将设置为100%不透明度/音量。
:::
::::

@en :::: details ### Audio Bus Track Bug caused by Vegas Pro
@zh :::: details ### Vegas Pro引起的音频总线轨道错误

@en **Detailed Description of the Question:**
@zh **问题详细描述：**
@en > When the project contains **audio bus tracks** other than the master audio bus, **I cannot render the project to a WAV *(Microsoft Wave)* file and a W64 *(Sony Wave64)* file** (the render progress immediately reaches 100%, but **no WAV file or W64 file is produced**). Why is it?
@zh > 当项目内添有除音频主控以外的**音频总线轨道**时，**无法将工程渲染为WAV *(Microsoft Wave)* 文件和W64 *(Sony Wave64)* 文件**（渲染进度立即跑满，但是**未渲染出WAV文件或W64文件**）？
@en > Also, when I render to any other format, **all effect parameters on the audio bus tracks have no effect.**
@zh > 并且渲染其它任意格式时，**音频总线轨道的各种效果参数均不起作用？**

@en This is caused by **Multi Stream Render**. You need to go to **`Internal Preferences`**, search for `Enable Multi Stream Render`, and change it from `TRUE` to the default `FALSE`.
@zh 这个是**多流渲染**导致的。进入 **`内部首选项`**，搜索并找到 `Enable Multi Stream Render`，将其从 `TRUE` 修改为默认的 `FALSE`。

@en ::: tip How to Access `Internal Preferences`?
@zh ::: tip 如何进入 `内部首选项`？
@en * **Vegas Pro 18 and above:** Hold [[Shift]], then go to the top menu [[Options > Internal]].
@zh * **Vegas Pro 18 及以上：**按住 [[Shift]]，进入上方菜单栏的 [[选项 > 内部]]。
@en * **Vegas Pro 17 and below:** Hold [[Shift]], then go to the top menu [[Options > Preferences]], switch to the `Internal` tab.
@zh * **Vegas Pro 17 及以下：**按住 [[Shift]]，进入上方菜单栏的 [[选项 > 首选项]]，然后切换到 `内部` 选项卡。
:::

@en **Why did this bug occur?** Firstly, the Vegas official does not expect you to deliberately modify the **Internal Preferences**. They believe that the **default settings** are the most suitable for general users to use. Unless you proactively modify the setting. If you download and install the so-called *“Vegas Optimization Solution”* registry file elsewhere, they may turn on the **`Multi Stream Render`** settings, even if you don’t know how these files have tampered with your settings.
@zh **为什么会出现此问题？**首先官方是不期望你特意修改**内部首选项**的，他们认为**默认设置**是最适合普通用户使用的。除非你主动去修改该设置以外。如果你在其它地方下载并安装了所谓的*“Vegas优化方案”*注册表文件，则他们可能会将 **`多流渲染`** 设置打开，即便你并不知道这些文件对你的设置动了哪些手脚。
::::

