@zh   * 选择所选内容中轨道剪辑的顺序。
@en * **Select how many at a time**
@zh * **每次要选取几段**
@en   * Selects how many clips at a time per group.
@zh   * 选择每组一次有多少个剪辑。
@en * **Reset Selection**
@zh * **重置选择**
@en   * Resets back to the selection pre-running the script.
@zh   * 重置回运行脚本前的选择。

