@zh _设置所选事件剪辑的属性。_

@en ![Quick Config Properties](/img/v4/tools/quick_config_properties.png){.shadow-less}
@zh ![快速配置属性](/img/v4/tools/quick_config_properties_zh-CN.png){.shadow-less}

@en ### Video clips
@zh ### 视频剪辑
@en * Hide
